        "name": "v0.16.0",
        "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Make `tea issues create` honor `--output json` in [#1114](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1114)\r\n* fix(pulls): report the real reason when a merge is refused in [#1107](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1107)\r\n* Make `tea pulls create` honor `--output json` in [#1111](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1111)\r\n* fix(deps): update module golang.org/x/crypto to v0.56.0 [security] in [#1109](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1109)\r\n* fix(deps): update module golang.org/x/crypto to v0.55.0 [security] in [#1106](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1106)\r\n* feat(login): add status command (#1087) in [#1105](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1105)\r\n* fix(login): avoid panic when parsing auto-discovered SSH keys in [#1100](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1100)\r\n* Read issue/PR description from stdin or a file in [#1096](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1096)\r\n* fix(deps): update go toolchain directive to v1.26.6 [security] in [#1103](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1103)\r\n* chore(deps): update docker/login-action digest to dbcb813 in [#1082](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1082)\r\n* fix(oauth): don't wait for the browser opener to exit in [#1093](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1093)\r\n* Drop AWS S3 release upload, keep only Cloudflare R2 in [#1092](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1092)\r\n* chore: align go version handling with gitea in [#1088](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1088)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n* @ongolk\r\n* @jbaer\r\n* @renovate-bot\r\n* @lunny\r\n* @jamesbraid\r\n* @silverwind\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @jbaer made their first contribution in [#1107](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1107)\r\n* @ongolk made their first contribution in [#1111](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1111)\r\n* @jamesbraid made their first contribution in [#1093](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1093)\r\n* @silverwind made their first contribution in [#1088](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1088)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: [v0.15.1...v0.16.0](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/compare/v0.15.1...v0.16.0)\r\n",
