      {
        "id": 905731,
        "tag_name": "v0.15.0",
        "target_commitish": "61b8536e4a3e04d9db74b05b4d9cd489d07d8d50",
        "name": "v0.15.0",
        "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* ci(goreleaser): mirror release artifacts to Cloudflare R2 in [#1063](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1063)\r\n* fix(context): clarify the fallback login prompt wording in [#1061](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1061)\r\n* Fix notifications --mine outside git repositories in [#1056](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1056)\r\n* ci: wait for the gitea service to be ready before integration tests in [#1062](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1062)\r\n* feat(assignees): add set, add, and remove assignees APIs in [#1045](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1045)\r\n* fix(deps): update go dependencies in [#1057](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1057)\r\n* fix(deps): update go dependencies in [#1051](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1051)\r\n* fix(theme): don't query the terminal at start-up in [#1054](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1054)\r\n* upgrade go sdk and add test in [#1048](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1048)\r\n* feat(comments): accept -d/--description for comment body in [#1043](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1043)\r\n* Add reply to code review in [#978](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/978)\r\n* fix(http): add transport timeouts so tea fails fast on stalled servers in [#1020](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1020)\r\n* fix(config): write to keychain before config in [#1044](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1044)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n* @lunny\r\n* @zachwinter\r\n* @wingsallen\r\n* @renovate-bot\r\n* @willemkokke\r\n* @coffbr01\r\n* @dinsmoor\r\n* @techknowlogick\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @zachwinter made their first contribution in [#1062](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1062)\r\n* @willemkokke made their first contribution in [#1054](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1054)\r\n* @coffbr01 made their first contribution in [#1043](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/pulls/1043)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: [v0.14.2...v0.15.0](https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/compare/v0.14.2...v0.15.0)\r\n",
